.github/copilot-instructions.md:111:When an issue title starts with **Weekly Copilot full-bot bug audit**, switch from strategy research to independent software-audit mode. Audit the entire repository at the exact source commit named in the issue, including EVM and Solana execution paths, accounting/P&L, databases, concurrency, retries/timeouts, Telegram permissions, workflows/deployment interactions, configuration, Strategy Lab/shadow logic and tests.
.github/copilot-instructions.md:119:- create only the two report files requested by the issue under `.ai/weekly/copilot/`;
.github/copilot-instructions.md:120:- set `provider=copilot`, `scope=FULL_REPOSITORY_BUG_AUDIT`, `report_only=true`, and `no_live_changes=true`;
.github/copilot-instructions.md:122:- do not implement fixes until a later GPT master-decision workflow has independently adjudicated all three agent reports.
